{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025110/extras/54121b6c4c7e697a22ed61d0b554e42f.avif?t=1758893928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025110/extras_big/54121b6c4c7e697a22ed61d0b554e42f.avif?t=1758893928 width=1560 height=520 /></span>Aphonia is a narrative puzzle game about the erosion of sound and the act of listening. Players accompany Leelo, a mute being with an extraordinary sensitivity to what others no longer notice. On an island where sound once held the balance of life, no one listens anymore. But Leelo does and hears what others don\u2019t: the world sounding wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through sound-based puzzles and environmental storytelling, players restore fragments of sonic memory. Not through combat or dialogue \u2013 but through attention, presence, and listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aphonia is more than a metaphor. It speaks to social, emotional, and relational disconnection. It invites players to slow down, to listen to the game, to the world and to themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-driven puzzles</strong> \u2013 Timing, resonance, and rhythm form the core of gameplay, accessible without musical knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover an island shaped by silence and slowly restore its sonic balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving soundscape</strong> \u2013 Each restored area shifts visually and acoustically, making progress tangible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative depth</strong> \u2013 A reflective story about disconnection, presence, and the simple act of listening.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025110?t=1758893928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025110?t=1758893928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025110/e196db347178e7e3bb40a76637f513b172926d8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758893928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025110/e196db347178e7e3bb40a76637f513b172926d8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758893928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025110/extras/54121b6c4c7e697a22ed61d0b554e42f.avif?t=1758893928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025110/extras_big/54121b6c4c7e697a22ed61d0b554e42f.avif?t=1758893928 width=1560 height=520 /></span>Aphonia is a narrative puzzle game about the erosion of sound and the act of listening. Players accompany Leelo, a mute being with an extraordinary sensitivity to what others no longer notice. On an island where sound once held the balance of life, no one listens anymore. But Leelo does and hears what others don\u2019t: the world sounding wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through sound-based puzzles and environmental storytelling, players restore fragments of sonic memory. Not through combat or dialogue \u2013 but through attention, presence, and listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aphonia is more than a metaphor. It speaks to social, emotional, and relational disconnection. It invites players to slow down, to listen to the game, to the world and to themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-driven puzzles</strong> \u2013 Timing, resonance, and rhythm form the core of gameplay, accessible without musical knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover an island shaped by silence and slowly restore its sonic balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving soundscape</strong> \u2013 Each restored area shifts visually and acoustically, making progress tangible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative depth</strong> \u2013 A reflective story about disconnection, presence, and the simple act of listening.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Moonflux Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025110/c4505409afb7a950d83410d07abe1962cc5a31c1/header.jpg?t=1758893928","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4025110/1074153876/b9a420c0e6d1b1d9c346273f6dcec6476f24e9c4/1758551937/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758813941","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4025110/1074153876/b9a420c0e6d1b1d9c346273f6dcec6476f24e9c4/1758551937/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758813941","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4025110/1074153876/b9a420c0e6d1b1d9c346273f6dcec6476f24e9c4/1758551937/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758813941","id":257204051,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204051/movie480.mp4?t=1758813941","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204051/movie_max.mp4?t=1758813941"},"name":"Aphonia_Teasertrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204051/eb785084805c118cbc7a4979c74394955991b59c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758813941","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204051/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758813941","max":"https://video.akamai.st